// Barnacle Bay - Harbour Showcase
//
// A two-file example that exercises most of Bubbles' language features in one
// playable scene.  harbour.bub contains the main dockside scene; services.bub
// holds the shared beats it detoures into.
//
// Run:
//   cargo run -p bubbles-tui -- examples/harbour/harbour.bub examples/harbour/services.bub
//
// Features demonstrated in this file:
//   - Node tags (scene / location metadata)
//   - <<declare>> typed variables
//   - <<if>> / <<else>> conditionals based on a visit flag
//   - Guarded options with <<if>> (gold >= threshold)
//   - <<detour>> into a cross-file node and <<return>>
//   - <<once>> / <<else>> / <<endonce>> for one-off content
//   - Line groups (=>) with BestLeastRecentlyViewed saliency for ambient barks
//   - Inline {$variable} interpolation
//   - <<command>> dispatch (<<stamp_permit>>)
//   - <<jump>> for a one-way transition

title: Start
tags: scene docks outdoor
---
<<declare $gold = 25>>
<<declare $has_permit = false>>
<<declare $met_stumpy = false>>

=> Dockworker: Oi, watch yer step!
=> Dockworker: These crates won't unload themselves, ye know.
=> Dockworker: Smells like low tide and regret out here.
=> Dockworker: Cap'n said the tide turns at noon. Better hurry.

<<if $met_stumpy>>
    Stumpy: You again. Permit still costs ten doubloons.
<<else>>
    Stumpy: Name's McGee. Stumpy McGee, Harbormaster.
    Stumpy: Ye can't sail from Barnacle Bay without a travel permit.
    <<set $met_stumpy = true>>
<<endif>>

<<once>>
    Stumpy: Word is there's a three-headed sea creature lurking past Dead Man's Reef.
    Stumpy: Whole fleet turned back. Brave sailors, every one of 'em.
<<else>>
    Stumpy: Aye, same tale about the sea creature. Nothing new to report.
<<endonce>>

<<jump Options>>
===

title: Options
---
Stumpy: So. What'll it be?

-> Pay ten doubloons for a permit. <<if $gold >= 10>>
    <<set $gold = $gold - 10>>
    <<set $has_permit = true>>
    <<stamp_permit>>
    Stumpy: There she is. Official seal and everything.
    Stumpy: You have {$gold} doubloons left. Don't spend 'em all at once.
    <<jump Depart>>
-> Bribe him with everything you've got. <<if $gold >= 1 && $gold < 10>>
    Stumpy: Hah! {$gold} doubloons? That barely covers the ink for the stamp.
    Stumpy: Come back when ye've got more coin.
    <<jump Options>>
-> Ask about the map seller.
    <<detour MapSeller>>
    Stumpy: That old rogue sell ye anything useful?
    <<jump Options>>
-> Nothing. Just passing through.
    Stumpy: Then pass through somewhere else. This dock's busy.
    <<jump End>>
===

title: Depart
tags: scene transition
---
Stumpy: Safe sailing. And watch out for that sea creature.
<<jump End>>
===

title: End
tags: scene end
---
===
